WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.126
Mom: What do you want to plant this year?

2
00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:11.201
Rachel: I want to plant

3
00:00:11.202 --> 00:00:13.689
strawberries. Mom: That's great,

4
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.366
Rachel. What do you want to plant, Ricky?

5
00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:24.852
Ricky: It's a secret, Mom.

6
00:00:24.853 --> 00:00:42.474
Dad: Okay, you guys. Everyone, grab a

7
00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.818
shovel. First, we need to plant the seeds.

8
00:00:45.819 --> 00:00:48.923
Plant your seeds in straight lines. Rachel:

9
00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:55.806
Okay, Dad! Ricky:

10
00:00:55.807 --> 00:01:01.652
Soon, I will have a chocolate-covered-raisin tree.

11
00:01:01.653 --> 00:01:08.752
Then, I will climb the tree and eat chocolate-covered raisins all day. Mom:

12
00:01:08.753 --> 00:01:12.373
Ricky, are you planting your seeds? Ricky:

13
00:01:12.374 --> 00:01:19.406
Yes, Mom! I was just thinking about something.

14
00:01:19.407 --> 00:01:24.219
Rachel: This is hard work, Dad.

15
00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:28.604
Dad: Yes, it is. You are doing a good job, Rachel.

16
00:01:28.605 --> 00:01:31.544
Your strawberries will grow well.

17
00:01:31.545 --> 00:01:34.623
Mom: Ricky, what did you plant?

18
00:01:34.624 --> 00:01:39.864
Ricky: You'll see!

